From 945a0fba14fffb5d2471ab4acd3d72d8ef1648b6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 12:03:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat: background music selector + ffmpeg amix mixing

- Add music track selector card to Step 5 (Generate) in index.html
- Fetch /music-tracks on load, populate radio buttons dynamically
- Wire selected track into generate-video FormData as bg_music
- run_video_pipeline: when music_path set, use ffmpeg filter_complex
  amix to mix background track at 12% volume (-18dBish) looped for
  full video duration; voiceover always wins first:duration
- ffmpeg cmd split into two branches: with/without music

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ms6XhBCwEJ8HKRuTQiTHFS
